Package: com.samcejko.browser
Name: Surfari
Version: 1.1.90
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: A modern-web browser for jailbroken iOS 6
 Surfari opens today's websites on iOS 6 devices. It brings its own TLS 1.3
 and 1.2 connections with current root certificates, rewrites modern CSS and
 JavaScript for the iOS 6 engine, and adds ad blocking, a reader view, saved
 passwords and private browsing. Made for iOS 6.x on armv7 devices (tested on
 an iPad 2 with iOS 6.1.2). The page engine is iOS 6's own WebKit, which gets
 no security updates: read the security notice in the README.
Maintainer: samcejko
Author: samcejko
Homepage: https://github.com/samcejko/surfari
Section: Networking
Depends: firmware (>= 6.0), firmware (<< 7.0)
Icon: file:///Applications/Surfari.app/Icon.png
